  "limitations": [
    "Local short-duration cache microbenchmark, not HTTP/JNI/cloud or a long-running soak test",
    "Per-trial statistics retained; individual operation duration arrays are not exported",
    "No competing test process during measurement; host background activity is uncontrolled",
    "No CPU pinning, scheduler trace, RSS, allocator tracking or read-latency measurement",
    "128 hot keys; one in eight writes targets a hot key, remaining writes use unique keys",
    "Prepopulated capacity 4096, TTL 600 seconds; input keys/status objects prepared before timing",
    "Put latency includes contention, internal allocations, destruction and timing overhead",
    "Writer elapsed time excludes thread creation/input preparation but includes start barrier release, sample collection and clear operations",
    "Readers stop after writers finish, checked every 64 reads; counts include at most a final batch per reader",
    "Mixed-clear clears from writer zero every 1024 writes: nine clears per trial, so clear P95/P99 equal maximum",
    "Mixed-clear lowers occupancy and changes hit rate; lower write latency is not evidence clearing improves performance",
    "No comparison to the previous eviction implementation; outlier causes are not attributed without profiling"
